---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Consulting — Kostis Dovelos"
  description="Dovelos Engineering: a wireless engineering consultancy serving defense, space, and telecom clients, from algorithm design and fixed-point modeling to DSP/FPGA implementation and field testing."
>
  <section class="about-grid">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Consulting</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        Dovelos Engineering is a wireless engineering consultancy serving defense, space, and
        telecom clients. Backed by a decade of academic research and industrial experience, we bridge
        the gap between mathematical theory and hardware, taking communications systems from algorithm
        design to DSP/FPGA implementation and field testing.
      </p>
    </article>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Services</h2>
      <ul class="capability-list">
        <li>Architecture and trade-off studies for tactical and UxV datalinks, from requirements to link and system budgets.</li>
        <li>Waveform and modem design for harsh propagation environments, such as high-Doppler and low-SNR conditions.</li>
        <li>DSP and FPGA implementation of signal processing pipelines, from fixed-point models to RTL verification.</li>
        <li>Array signal processing: MIMO, adaptive beamforming, and direction finding.</li>
        <li>MAC and network design for MANETs: link adaptation, power control, and routing under jamming.</li>
        <li>System validation and characterization, from hardware-in-the-loop testing to field trials.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">RF digital twins</h2>
      <ul class="capability-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Installed antennas.</strong> Full-wave EM simulation of arrays mounted on the
          airframe, to predict and calibrate direction-finding and beamforming performance. See
          <a href="/posts/when-the-airframe-joins-the-array/"><em>When the airframe joins the array</em></a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Radio environment.</strong> Site-specific ray tracing coupled with network
          simulation for coverage, link planning, and EW scenario analysis.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Engagement models</h2>
      <ul class="capability-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Technical consulting.</strong> Targeted architecture sprints, contract engineering,
          and technical advisory for next-generation wireless systems.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>R&amp;D partnerships.</strong> Joint proposals and consortium participation for
          ESA, EU, and national space and defense initiatives.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="contact-line">
        Enquiries: <a href="mailto:konstantinos.dovelos@gmail.com">konstantinos.dovelos@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
